Error [E0712]: This `#FX` region uses the effect `Net`, which it has no authority for
  --> nested_grant_cannot_widen_outer_authority.jet:4:20
    |
  4 |         #FX(inner: Net) {}
    |                    ^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` allows only `FS`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: Add `Net` to the `#FX(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: #FX
 Scope chain: #FX
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0712
